\item[* modification:]\mbox{}
\begin{enumerate}
\item date: 05/01/89\ \ \ \ \ author: Lisette Appelo
\item date: 20/09/90\ \ \ \ \ author: Elena Pinillos\
 gesplitst in two rules in order to account for the difference
 in case of the object of 'según' and the object of other
 prepositions
\end{enumerate}
\item[* task:] assigns prepositive case to a NP that appears into
               a PREPP with every preposition but 'según'  as head   
\item[\ \ strategy:] (also: deviations from accepted proposals)
\item[\ \ rejected alternatives:]
